", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/6b5da0ef30d705c2a91e.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "67:22", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5263.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Is he who goeth groping on his face more rightly guided, or he who walketh upright on a straight road?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Şimdi yüz üstü kapanarak yürüyen mi doğru gider, yoksa dosdoğru yolda yürüyen mi?", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو کیا وہ جو اپنے منہ کے بل اوندھا چلے زیادہ راہ پر ہے یا وہ جو سیدھا چلے سیدھی راہ پر", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka apakah orang yang berjalan terjungkal di atas mukanya itu lebih banyak mendapatkan petunjuk ataukah orang yang berjalan tegap di atas jalan yang lurus?", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "أَفَمَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَمْشِى", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/94e961e5dffb2e3e3541.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "he/it walks", "bs": "hoda", "tr": "yürür", "fr": "il marche", "id": "dia berjalan", "ur": "وہ چلتا ہے", "bn": "সে হাঁটে", "fa": "راه می‌رود"}}, {"text": "مُكِبًّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَجْهِهِۦٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَهْدَىٰٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَمَّن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَمْشِى", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/94e961e5dffb2e3e3541.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "he/it walks", "bs": "hoda", "tr": "yürür", "fr": "il marche", "id": "dia berjalan", "ur": "وہ چلتا ہے", "bn": "সে হাঁটে", "fa": "راه می‌رود"}}, {"text": "سَوِيًّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "صِرَٰطٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُّسْتَقِيمٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "25:63", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2918.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "The (faithful) slaves of the Beneficent are they who walk upon the earth modestly, and when the foolish ones address them answer: Peace;", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "O çok merhametli Allah'ın (has) kulları onlardır ki, yeryüzünde tevazu ile yürürler ve cahil kimseler kendilerine laf attığı zaman (incitmeksizin) \"selam\" derler (geçerler).", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور رحمن کے وہ بندے کہ زمین پر آہستہ چلتے ہیں اور جب جاہل ان سے بات کرتے ہیں تو کہتے ہیں بس سلام", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan hamba-hamba Tuhan yang Maha Penyayang itu (ialah) orang-orang yang berjalan di atas bumi dengan rendah hati dan apabila orang-orang jahil menyapa mereka, mereka mengucapkan kata-kata (yang mengandung) keselamatan.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَعِبَادُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَمْشُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/72c37d6f86b73459b32f.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "hodaju", "en": "they walk", "tr": "yürürler", "fr": "ils marchent", "id": "mereka berjalan", "ur": "وہ چلتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা হাঁটে", "fa": "راه می‌روند"}}, {"text": "عَلَى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هَوْنًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَإِذَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "خَاطَبَهُمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْجَٰهِلُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قَالُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "سَلَٰمًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "38:6", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3976.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "The chiefs among them go about, exhorting: Go and be staunch to your gods! Lo! this is a thing designed.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "İçlerinden ileri gelenler fırladılar ve dediler ki: \"İlâhlarınız üzerinde sabır ve sebat edin. Bu, gerçekten arzu edilen bir murad!\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور ان میں کے سردار چلے کہ اس کے پاس سے چل دو اور اپنے خداؤں پر صابر رہو بیشک اس میں اس کا کوئی مطلب ہے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan pergilah pemimpin-pemimpin mereka (seraya berkata): \"Pergilah kamu dan tetaplah (menyembah) tuhan-tuhanmu, sesungguhnya ini benar-benar suatu hal yang dikehendaki.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَٱنطَلَقَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْمَلَأُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِنْهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَنِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱمْشُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/4e21b5211b5246334b4d.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "idite", "en": "walk on", "tr": "yürüyün", "fr": "marchez !", "id": "berjalanlah", "ur": "چلتے رہو", "bn": "চলতে থাকো", "fa": "راه بروید"}}, {"text": "وَٱصْبِرُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلَىٰٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ءَالِهَتِكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هَٰذَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَشَىْءٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُرَادُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "يَمْشِى", "count": 6, "first": "6:122", "audio": "audio/58cc2c2ae9e2e90b4c52.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it walks", "bs": "hoda", "tr": "yürür", "fr": "il marche", "id": "dia berjalan", "ur": "وہ چلتا ہے", "bn": "সে হাঁটে", "fa": "راه می‌رود"}}, {"arabic": "يَمْشُونَ", "count": 5, "first": "7:195", "audio": "audio/72c37d6f86b73459b32f.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"bs": "hodaju", "en": "they walk", "tr": "yürürler", "fr": "ils marchent", "id": "mereka berjalan", "ur": "وہ چلتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা হাঁটে", "fa": "راه می‌روند"}}, {"arabic": "تَمْشِ", "count": 2, "first": "17:37", "audio": "audio/ba72c487c726ba75d3ac.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "jussive"}]}, {"arabic": "مَّشَوْا۟", "count": 1, "first": "2:20", "audio": "audio/8d94dce04e60339a9911.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "they walked", "bs": "hodali su", "tr": "yürüdüler", "fr": "ils ont marché", "id": "mereka telah berjalan", "ur": "وہ چلے", "bn": "তারা হেঁটেছিল", "fa": "راه رفتند"}}, {"arabic": "تَمْشِىٓ", "count": 1, "first": "20:40", "audio": "audio/32f081f57bc3bea7efde.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}]}, {"arabic": "وَيَمْشِى", "count": 1, "first": "25:7", "audio": "audio/e382f4473f5bf04b9572.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": 